This license covers the code in this repository. Third-party material bundled
under src/public/ keeps its own terms:

  src/public/player/spc.wasm
      The SPC700 emulator core from @smwcentral/spc-player, vendored unmodified
      and licensed under the GNU LGPL 2.1. Built on Blargg's snes_spc and
      maintained by Telinc1 for SMW Central. Its license text sits beside it at
      src/public/player/LICENSE; see src/public/player/README.txt for the
      provenance and update procedure.

  src/public/driver/
      The assembled SPC700 driver (main.bin), the SPC and DSP register bases,
      and the #default BRR sample set are produced by AddmusicK, whose sample
      set in turn originates from Super Mario World. They are redistributed
      here under the same practice the SMW hacking community has long followed;
      downloadable as binaries. This is a community norm rather than a grant from
      the rights holders. Credit for the driver goes to the AddmusicK maintainers.
